window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"masteryi","b":"locke","win":["Locke","Locke","Locke","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Survival mode: his nail poke and on-hit stakes bleed your itemless kit and his E reset dodges your only engage - farm what is safe and concede the rest."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Careful at 6: Purgatory grounds you, so Alpha Strike will not carry you out of the zone - leave before he casts it and never trade near his execute floor."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Wuju true damage now out-races his burst window - start taking the extended trades he used to win, and punish every whiffed nail with a full rotation."},{"when":"Late","text":"Two-plus items you out-scale him completely: Highlander resets shred his squishy frame and his one-combo kit cannot answer a second target - hunt him."}],"wants":{"you":["Safe farming through his poke era","Leave the zone before Purgatory lands","Late resets cashed on his squishy frame"],"foe":["Free nail chip on your itemless levels","W Soul Ignition burst before your spike","The totem placed where your Q cannot dodge it"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 are his: Q Ritual Nails poke plus on-hit stakes bleed your bare kit, and his E Ashen Pursuit reset slides away from the single Alpha Strike you can answer with - do not force it. Take what CS is safe, Meditate the chip back, and remember every minion matters more than pride here.","mid":"Levels 4-5 even out as your resets and ramping attack speed let you farm through the poke and threaten real trades. At 6 it is a skill window: Purgatory executes low targets and grounds you inside it, so Alpha Strike is not an exit - break off before he casts and take the fight outside the zone.","late":"Your first item breaks the lane open - Wuju Style true damage out-races his one W Soul Ignition burst window - and from two items you simply out-scale him: Highlander resets shred his squishy frame, his execute never fires because you dodge it on reaction, and no Locke combo kills you through lifeline sustain. Hunt him everywhere.","whys":["His nail poke and on-hit stakes bully your bare melee kit from level 1.","At 2 his poke-slow pattern still beats your single Alpha Strike answer.","Level 3 stays his - marks into W burst chunk you while his E dodges your engage.","Levels 4-5 even out as your resets and ramping attack speed let you farm through the poke.","Level 6 is a skill window - Purgatory grounds you, so leave early and let Highlander force the fight.","Your first item and Wuju true damage out-race his burst window.","Two-plus items your resets and true-damage DPS out-scale his one-combo kit."]});

