window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"masteryi","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Zaahen","Zaahen","Zaahen","Skill","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2-5","text":"His prime: his 10s dash reaches you on every wave and its damage scales off your max health, so stacking HP will not save you - farm with Alpha Strike, Meditate it back, refuse his brawls."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander evens the fight - Grim Deliverance (R) heals him off the damage it deals, so bring Grievous Wounds and go untargetable in Alpha Strike as he stabs, then out-reset him."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Wuju true damage pulls the duel even against his drain - start answering his commits instead of eating them, but only with Q available to dodge his R."},{"when":"2 items","text":"Your Double Strike true-damage stream now out-duels his whole rotation - hunt the sidelane fight he used to win and take his towers with it."}],"wants":{"you":["Safe farm through his early prime","Alpha Strike held for his knockup","Late duels where resets beat his drain"],"foe":["Q-E commits before your items arrive","A snowball built off your early deaths","Grim Deliverance (R) landed on you low"]},"early":"Level 1 is quiet farming - neither kit has its all-in tools yet. Then comes his prime: at 2 his dash reaches you at will and beats your single Alpha Strike answer, and from 3 the full rotation bursts you - his W stabs from 850 units and pulls you in, and his Q is an auto-reset that heals him. Give ground, farm with Q, and Meditate the chip away.","mid":"Levels 4-5 stay his as glaive poke taxes your farm and his stats win every straight commit - survive on CS discipline and jungle presence, not heroics. At 6 the fight finally evens: Grim Deliverance (R) heals him off its own damage on a 110s cooldown, so shred that heal, use Alpha Strike's untargetable window on the stab, and let Highlander's resets flip the long fight.","late":"Your first item pulls the duel even - Wuju true damage races his drain to a draw - and from two items the lane's whole story inverts: your Double Strike true-damage stream out-duels his rotation, his lock loses to your Q dodge more often than it lands, and the sidelane he owned all game becomes your hunting ground. Scale, then collect.","whys":["Level 1 is even farm - no all-in tools online for either side.","Level 2 is his: E Golden Onslaught reaches you and his Q-E trade beats your single Alpha Strike.","Level 3 stays his - the full Q-W-E rotation bursts you while his W resets deny your answer.","Levels 4-5 keep him ahead as glaive poke taxes your farm and his bruiser stats win every commit.","Level 6 is even - Highlander's resets against Grim Deliverance's drain comes down to timing.","Your first item spikes your DPS but his drain and tankiness hold the duel even.","Two-plus items your Double Strike true-damage stream out-duels his rotation."]});
